{"id":"wb-7-1018","name":"华堂王氏宗祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"华堂王氏宗祠","text":"华堂王氏宗祠浙江省绍兴市嵊州市金庭镇华堂村，由大宗祠和新祠堂两座祠堂组成。大宗祠始建于明正德七年（公元1512年），是为祭祀王羲之三十六世孙王琼夫妇而筑。建筑面南向，面积约1800平方米。华堂村是王氏聚居地，华堂王氏宗祠对研究王氏家族文化具有重要意义。2013年5月，列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%8E%E5%A0%82%E7%8E%8B%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":84935921,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84935921","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/203ee2b32572deaa14b88b6d.jpg","title":"华堂王氏宗祠,_2021-04-05_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8D%8E%E5%A0%82%E7%8E%8B%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0,_2021-04-05_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/%E5%8D%8E%E5%A0%82%E7%8E%8B%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0%2C_2021-04-05_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​华堂王氏宗祠（大祠堂）","width":320,"height":214}}